Subject: [PATCH 21/31] BlueOS: SystemUI: BlueOS defaults on a fresh phone

- BlueOSDefaults (once, before setup finishes; updates keep the user's
  choices): light theme, the brand palette with "Bright colors"
  (VIBRANT), always-on display, widget cards 15 % transparent.
- Lock screen shortcuts: flashlight on the left, camera on the right.
- Lock screen widgets: screen time, battery, equalizer (own default list;
  the allowlist is unchanged).

